      "writtenOn": "2020-11-04T08:49:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree here, keeping with what is in upstream is the key to maintaining stuff long-term.  If there is a proven workload speedup with this patch, and no decrease in any other workload, then upstream should be glad to take it, otherwise this is probably just not worth the cost of the maintenance burden (if we add a new userspace api like this, we have to support it for forever.)",
